     "v2.0: termination by '30 days’ prior written notice to OPA'. v3.1.1: termination must be '30 days’ prior written notice in the Prescribed Form to OPA'."}
    {:section "Part 9 (Amendment)",
     :change_type "modified",
     :details
     "v2.0 required amendments to be 'reduced to writing' and agreed by both parties. v3.1.1 requires amendments to be 'reduced to writing in the Prescribed Form' and agreed by both parties."}
    {:section
     "Part 6.5 (Collection of Information / Disclosure of Information)",
     :change_type "modified",
     :details
     "v2.0 text listed examples of information that may be obtained/disclosed and explicitly included 'information to establish compliance with Minimum Required Domestic Content Level'. v3.1.1 removes the explicit domestic content reference in that clause and adds a sentence explicitly allowing disclosure to other ministries/agencies for 'promoting public health and safety' and 'allowing emergency services personnel' for planning and response."}
    {:section "Appendix A - Definitions (added)",
     :change_type "added",
     :details
     "New definitions added in v3.1.1: 'Prescribed Form' and 'Website' (OPA microFIT website URL)."}
    {:section "Appendix A - Definitions (removed/modified)",
